    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Every time you shoot an enemy, music is born.&quot; The heartbeat of rock becomes your aim. An impulse shooting game with anime song rock and lock-on! &quot;Sonic Valkyria: KANON&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our proprietary music engine allows guitars and pianos to ring out dynamically in time with the background music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a whole new gaming experience that combines the feeling of playing the music yourself with the exhilaration of shooting down enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 A new type of \u201cperformance-style\u201d shooter is here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605Main gameplay methods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbLock-on beam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/0651d3d167a93f556b4dc3f7c4c4c4cd.poster.avif?t=1755128618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/0651d3d167a93f556b4dc3f7c4c4c4cd.webm?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/0651d3d167a93f556b4dc3f7c4c4c4cd.mp4?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume the MP gauge to lock on and fire the beam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The MP gauge recovers automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbShield Guard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/956cda59d1455b2c7e5023ba4c1e67ad.poster.avif?t=1755128618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/956cda59d1455b2c7e5023ba4c1e67ad.webm?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/956cda59d1455b2c7e5023ba4c1e67ad.mp4?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While holding down the guard button, you can deploy a shield and guard by consuming MP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbCharge shot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/ffe7053c4340137f43f81f5e7d5eba54.poster.avif?t=1755128618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/ffe7053c4340137f43f81f5e7d5eba54.webm?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/ffe7053c4340137f43f81f5e7d5eba54.mp4?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While locked on, you can fill up the charge gauge for a powerful charge shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a charge shot to wipe out enemies with high health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these actions strategically depending on the situation on the battlefield to save the world! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Every time you shoot an enemy, music is born.&quot; The heartbeat of rock becomes your aim. An impulse shooting game with anime song rock and lock-on! &quot;Sonic Valkyria: KANON&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our proprietary music engine allows guitars and pianos to ring out dynamically in time with the background music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a whole new gaming experience that combines the feeling of playing the music yourself with the exhilaration of shooting down enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 A new type of \u201cperformance-style\u201d shooter is here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605Main gameplay methods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbLock-on beam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/0651d3d167a93f556b4dc3f7c4c4c4cd.poster.avif?t=1755128618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/0651d3d167a93f556b4dc3f7c4c4c4cd.webm?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/0651d3d167a93f556b4dc3f7c4c4c4cd.mp4?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume the MP gauge to lock on and fire the beam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The MP gauge recovers automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbShield Guard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/956cda59d1455b2c7e5023ba4c1e67ad.poster.avif?t=1755128618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/956cda59d1455b2c7e5023ba4c1e67ad.webm?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/956cda59d1455b2c7e5023ba4c1e67ad.mp4?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While holding down the guard button, you can deploy a shield and guard by consuming MP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbCharge shot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/ffe7053c4340137f43f81f5e7d5eba54.poster.avif?t=1755128618\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/ffe7053c4340137f43f81f5e7d5eba54.webm?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558970/extras/ffe7053c4340137f43f81f5e7d5eba54.mp4?t=1755128618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While locked on, you can fill up the charge gauge for a powerful charge shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a charge shot to wipe out enemies with high health.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these actions strategically depending on the situation on the battlefield to save the world! </p>",
